#### 6.6.3 Summary Report

::: panel-tabset
## AM



```{r}
#| eval: false
ehsa_summary_am <- ehsa_am_map %>%
  st_drop_geometry() %>%
  count(classification) %>%
  mutate(
    percentage = round(100 * n / sum(n), 1),
    label = sprintf("%s: %d (%.1f%%)", classification, n, percentage)
  ) 
write_rds(ehsa_summary_am, "data/rds/ehsa_summary_am.rds")
```

